Example
1. No dependency passed:
useEffect(() => {
  //Runs on every render
});

Example
2. An empty array:
useEffect(() => {
  //Runs only on the first render
}, []);

Example
3. Props or state values:
useEffect(() => {
  //Runs on the first render
  //And any time any dependency value changes
}, [prop, state]);

